      "content": "It's a perfectly normal feeling, this sudden emptiness after reaching a massive goal. You climbed so hard for a picture that turned out to be a blank wall; what's left to chase now? Maybe the real victory isn't in the title, but in the freedom to finally decide what *you* want to do with this incredible momentum. You've proven you can endure anything, so now you can prove you can choose the most meaningful way to finally stop.",
